    "note": "Every entrant submitted one roleplay of up to 3,000 words; four judges ranked all thirty from best to worst and the judges' own combined point totals set the final order recorded here. The fed's own hosts state that only the winner (Shawn-Jessica Hart) and the runner-up position were guaranteed to match the judged ranking; the remaining placements were also meant to reflect each entrant's own time in the match and number of eliminations, storylined to let as many entrants interact as possible. No blow-by-blow account of the match itself (who eliminated whom, and in what order beyond the top two) survives in the held record; the fed's own hosts describe writing that account for broadcast on their podcast, which this census does not capture."
